        <h1 id="product-title">ChemSynt 301 Chemical<br>Synthesis Reactor</h1>
        <div class="hero-copy__bottom">
          <p class="hero-lede">Compact, fully integrated, modular, and scalable laboratory reaction workstation enabling precise control of temperature, pH, reagent dosing, and magnetic or mechanical stirring. Remote control and data logging ensure safe, reproducible, unattended experimentation.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button--primary" href="/pages/ChemSynt-301-Chemical-Synthesis-Reactor-configurator">Configure Your System</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
